SUMMARY:Topics in RISC-V Linux kernel maintenance
LOCATION:Small Theatre\, Prague Congress Centre
DESCRIPTION:RISC-V MC · Paul Walmsley\, Palmer Dabbelt · https://lpc.even
 ts/event/20/contributions/2405/\n\nReview the past year in RISC-V Linux ke
 rnel maintenance\, and discuss upcoming plans for the next year - similar 
 to what we did last year
URL:https://lpc.events/event/20/contributions/2405/
